#: f67cb1937f2441a8a3fb24b4e3fd1a79
msgid ""
"Plug one end of the accessory cable into the camera's 7-pin DF13 connector "
"(found next to the micro USB port) and then the other 6-pin connector to one"
" of the autopilot's telemetry ports.  In this example Telem2 is used."
msgstr ""
"将配件线缆一端插入相机的7针DF13连接器（位于micro USB端口旁），另一端6针连接器插入飞控的一个数传端口。本示例使用Telem2。"

