"To allow triggering the taking of pictures during a mission or from a "
"transmitter's auxiliary switch connect the \"P3\" 3-pin servo connector to "
"the one of the autopilot's servo outputs.  In this example AUX OUT 1 (aka "
"SERVO9) is used.  Then set the following parameters (Assuming the Camera1 "
"instance):"
msgstr ""
"要允许在任务执行期间或通过发射机辅助开关触发拍照，将「P3」3针舵机连接器连接到飞控的某个舵机输出。本示例使用AUX OUT "
"1（即SERVO9）。然后设置以下参数（假设使用Camera1实例）："

