#: 889877b5545344b7955511f2f529789b 9c06b08f37ac41b3964b15a794ed9aa7
#: d22e878fc1f34cedbe839e840bb56484 e6883e0f940d427295b2e04b703db01c
#: ea3b6ce0f92149ce8928710a7ca7ce4e
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:62
#: 4c9d75f34f5e4a00bd428659dc93311e 4eee9455dc9b497b9265136d255bcf91
#: 5b79a5c4112445a09ef0c297879f46d5 61ece215fb844496aeb9a4fedd4a9e84
#: f8d07cabea9b4d69a5ace8195e2e9154
msgid ""
"Power up the camera and autopilot in a location where the vehicle can get a "
"GPS lock."
msgstr "在飞行器能获取GPS锁定的位置，为相机和飞控通电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:63
#: 29d9046a80a849d4a69aae105726c6e3 3d4ba192f5f541a29870fef2637ae001
#: 580358c180a64776850d0ef2caec1bd6 8ccd4e62c36c48e4bdfee94f1dde16f3
#: d9ddb770aa5b4f248360b5aa1ee1085b
msgid ""
"Connect with a ground station (like Mission Planner) and check that the "
"vehicle appears on the map"
msgstr "用地面站（如Mission Planner）连接，并确认飞行器出现在地图上"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:64
#: 0672a9370351479c97b1e4f55c9a79f4 2169b1471db9462e962d3dd8f6ea112d
#: c879617eed234daca64a25e1ce3bb007 db46498ed5824941a86e5724d4690e64
#: f15f7de99c7a4c38ae97b5e2969c51dd
msgid ""
"If the serial connection between the autopilot and camera is working then "
"shortly after the camera is powered on, it will begin sending heartbeats to "
"the autopilot and ground station which, if using the Mission Planner, will "
"make it appear as \"CAMERA\" in the top-right drop-down.  Selecting the "
"CAMERA will not work though because the camera does not respond to requests "
"for parameters"
msgstr ""
"若飞控与相机之间的串行连接正常，相机通电后不久即会向飞控和地面站发送心跳包，如果使用Mission "
"Planner，它将在右上角下拉菜单中显示为「CAMERA」。选择CAMERA不会起作用，因为相机不响应参数请求"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:69
#: 02106626ddac4eeaa56dc2e165553606 0695be48a14a4b9b999f96a7c3ba8cc5
#: 39873447e505475293b3fdfca4028b38 a7a8906d0ebb423d9e0f65a31429d8e1
#: c0ce6e0234fb4215b5c79c2137982c26
msgid ""
"Trigger taking a picture using the transmitter's auxiliary switch or by "
"right-mouse-button-clicking on the map and selecting \"Trigger Camera NOW\"."
"  The camera should beep"
msgstr "通过发射机辅助开关或在地图上点击鼠标右键并选择「立即触发相机」来拍照。相机应发出蜂鸣声"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:70
#: 0676793d5dae483f8b86f183fc441d56 1cb98e41fb114b85979a460a108e9a87
#: 8e025d18de6145a18dca61770912b51e a0fe48f83998463a815845628a5124d4
#: e798ddb2578f492ca33648be676fcc11
msgid ""
"Connect the camera to your computer using a USB cable (or remove the "
"camera's SD card) and check that an image has been captured"
msgstr "用USB线缆将相机连接到电脑（或取出相机SD卡），检查是否已拍摄图像"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:71
#: 4d59b22655614bd4ba05bf284e671233 5eeae86691d348619a4d1b5678365f04
#: 7d7112f5b1ce4a398e0b672dabfc4087 a4b483e423a3435fb72bbd21c118f1a4
#: e68dad2086b04e62aa047fcdcbf1e02e
msgid ""
"Check the file properties to ensure the latitude, longitude and altitude "
"have been recorded with the image"
msgstr "检查文件属性，确认图像已记录纬度、经度和高度"
